  "project_description": "The existing well known https://www.drupal.org/project/address module allows to chose the address, provide a lot validations, different addresses fields for a different countries. That is the great solution if you require from you users address for delivery, billing address etc.\n\nBut, many content sites needs simple address solution, without strict validations, still with some help for the user when selecting state/province for the selected country.\n\nThis module aims to solve that problem.\n\nIt uses the country/state&province repository from Address module.\n\n Supporting this Module \n Support this module if it is valuable for you or your organization https://buymeacoffee.com/itech4web",
